WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:13.156
Dashboards put the numbers you care about on one screen: open work, sales, and data from your connected tools. In this video, you’ll read a dashboard, ask what it says, add a widget, and build one with AI.

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:23.428
Open Dashboards. A dashboard is built from widgets: counts, tickets split by any field, overdue work, trends, and Square sales, side by side.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:27.835
Click Explain, and AI tells you what the numbers say, in a few points.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.423
Add widget lets you choose the data, what to measure, how to split it, and how to show it, with a live preview.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:41.224
Or describe the dashboard you want. AI builds it, and shows you a preview before anything is saved.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:51.800
Keep a dashboard to yourself, share it with a team, or with everyone. Pin it to one store or project, and every widget shows just that.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:01:00.651
Data from connected tools, like Square or QuickBooks, starts out for System Admins. Connected data is where they choose who may use it.

